### Upload XML bestand (bestandsmodus)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mode"

file
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.xml"
Content-Type: application/xml

< ../resources/test-roofvogels.xml
------boundary--

###

### Haal alle rijen op (standaard pagina)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 50
}

###

### Filter op roofvogel naam (contains)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 50,
  "filters": [
    {
      "field": "roofvogelName",
      "operator": "contains",
      "value": "Havik"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Filter op dier naam (startsWith) + sortering
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 10,
  "filters": [
    {
      "field": "dierName",
      "operator": "startsWith",
      "value": "F"
    }
  ],
  "sort": {
    "field": "roofvogelName",
    "direction": "ASC"
  }
}

###

### Meerdere filters gecombineerd (AND)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 50,
  "filters": [
    {
      "field": "roofvogelType",
      "operator": "equals",
      "value": "ROOFVOGEL"
    },
    {
      "field": "dierVirtual",
      "operator": "equals",
      "value": "false"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Validatiefout: ongeldige operator
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 50,
  "filters": [
    {
      "field": "roofvogelName",
      "operator": "INVALID_OP",
      "value": "test"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Validatiefout: paginagrootte te groot
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 9999
}

###

### Tweede pagina ophalen
POST http://localhost:8082/api/data
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 1,
  "size": 10,
  "sort": {
    "field": "roofvogelName",
    "direction": "DESC"
  }
}
